The fourth term of \eqref{eq: KL_bound_decomposition} is the discretization error of simulating the Brownian motion $g(\tau)\mathrm{d}\mathbf{B}(\tau)$ in \eqref{eq: reverse_SDE_DDPM} by $g(\tau_k)\sqrt{\Delta\tau}\zeta_k \overset{d}{=}g(\tau_k)\mathrm{d}\mathbf{B}(\tau)$ from $\tau_k$ to $\tau_{k + 1}$ in \eqref{eq: reverse_SDE_DDPM_simulation}. 
